<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.kapae.lowers ~ the hand takes the marker down, a deliberate signed act

Every wiki wears promotion capability; its edge holds (face, wiki, digest). The AI prepares and flags; the hand commits and raises. The brake sets one promoted item aside by a signed marker, and a lower takes the marker down. The wiki rides `--wiki` (absent: the daemon wiki), the face `--face N`, and every answer prints as JSON. The word names five doors in the house: the nexus quorum ban (`lares nexus kapae`) and a relation's marker (`lares edge kapae`) stay beside it, the seat's branch mute reads at `sense.kapae.mutes`, and a record's tombstone rides `lares tiddler delete`.

`kapae lower <digest>` takes the marker down so the item stands again; the lower signs under the face's grant and a ward route, so a person runs it at a real terminal.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ one-digest

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`one-digest` params=`digest/<digest> ~ lower the brake on one item`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ digest · wiki · face · keep · drop

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`digest` params=`takes/hex64 needs/required seat/1 as/<digest> ~ the promoted item's digest, 64 lowercase hex`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`wiki` params=`takes/wiki-name ~ the wiki the promotion belongs to; absent, the daemon wiki`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index ~ which face's promotion plane this call reads or acts on, by persona index (a whole number from 0)`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`keep` params=`~ read by no kapae act: the trust door's orphan decision names it, and a kapae line ignores it`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`drop` params=`~ read by no kapae act: the trust door's orphan decision names it, and a kapae line ignores it`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand ~ a hand alone lowers: an AI harness refuses kapae-needs-hand, naming the command the operator runs`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ promote-digest-malformed · kapae-needs-hand

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`promote-digest-malformed` params=`cure/[[realm.kapae.lowers digest/<digest>]] ~ name a hex64 digest`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`kapae-needs-hand` params=`cure/[[realm.offer.reads]] ~ a hand must lower`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

